### ==================== Tools: plain prompts, the model decides when to call one ====================

### Grounded via the MCP tool get-teams
GET http://localhost:8080/teams?group=A

### Grounded via the MCP tool get-venue
GET http://localhost:8080/venues?city=Dallas

### Grounded via the MCP tool get-fixtures
GET http://localhost:8080/fixtures?team=Morocco&stage=group stage

### No matching MCP tool exists for this one, so the model guesses
GET http://localhost:8080/featured-match?stage=quarter-finals

### Grounded via the MCP tool get-player
GET http://localhost:8080/players?name=Kylian Mbappé

### Grounded via the MCP tool get-match-result
GET http://localhost:8080/matches/result?fixture=Morocco vs Haiti

### Grounded via the MCP tool get-match-stats
GET http://localhost:8080/matches/stats?fixture=scotland vs brazil

### Grounded via the MCP tool get-referees
GET http://localhost:8080/referees

### Grounded via the MCP tool get-group-standings
GET http://localhost:8080/groups/standings?group=A

### Grounded via the MCP tool get-team-journey
GET http://localhost:8080/teams/journey?team=Morocco

### Grounded via the MCP tools get-goal-leaderboard / get-assist-leaderboard
GET http://localhost:8080/players/leaderboard?category=goals

### Grounded via the MCP tool get-news; also demonstrates PII redaction on the free-text team param (email)
GET http://localhost:8080/news?team=update me at fan@example.com about Iran

### Grounded via the MCP tool get-controversies; left as prose, a controversy is a narrative. Also demonstrates PII redaction (phone)
GET http://localhost:8080/controversies?team=update me on +61 2 8123 4567 about Egypt

### ==================== Resources: the application decides when to fetch these, not the model ====================

### Resource: worldcup://teams/{team}/squad
GET http://localhost:8080/squad?team=Morocco

### Resource: worldcup://fixtures/{date}
GET http://localhost:8080/schedule?date=15 June 2026

### Resource: worldcup://stadiums, returned as-is, no model call
GET http://localhost:8080/stadiums

### Resource: worldcup://groups/{group}/standings
GET http://localhost:8080/standings?group=A

### ==================== Prompts: templates owned by the server ====================

### Fetches the server's match-recap prompt instead of writing the text here
GET http://localhost:8080/recap?fixture=Morocco vs Spain

### ==================== Completions: autocomplete over small known sets, no LLM call ====================

### Completion for the match-recap prompt's fixture argument
GET http://localhost:8080/autocomplete/fixtures?prefix=Morocco

### Completion for the worldcup://teams/{team}/squad resource's team URI variable
GET http://localhost:8080/autocomplete/squad-teams?prefix=Mo
